# Placeholders only - never commit real values.
# The app has NO server on the free Spark plan, so there is nothing secret to store for it.
# Optional Gemini key: it is pasted into public/index.html (const GEMINI_API_KEY) and is therefore PUBLIC.
# Use a free-tier key with no billing account, restricted to your site address (README step 7).
